# OrderSkew deployment

OrderSkew is the standalone Trading Plan Calculator. Former tools and backend source are preserved in https://github.com/yanniedog/orderskew-tools-archive. Follow root AGENTS.md; do not restore or deploy those tools here.

- Production: https://www.orderskew.com and https://orderskew.com.
- Root index.html serves the static calculator. No build step or root dependencies; use Node 22+.
- Edit source assets, run `npm run assets:calculator`, and commit generated calculator-assets plus index.html.
- Before merge, run `npm run test:calculator` and JavaScript syntax checks. Work on a topic branch and use a pull request.
- Static deployments follow authorized main merges. The API catch-all returns 410 for removed tool APIs on every method; it has no tool functionality or data storage.
- After deployment, run `npm run test:production:all`. It must exit 0. Verify both production hostnames, calculator asset MIME types, hashes and checkout parity on each, and former tool/API routes with their supported methods. No checks may be skipped.
- Browser QA covers desktop/mobile edits, light/dark themes, live graph/table changes and console errors.
- If verification fails, fix the cause, redeploy and run the complete command again. Report the command, exit code and results by check group.
- Root 404.html prevents static SPA fallback at former tool paths. The former Vercel backend is disconnected from this repository.
